  "provenance_note": "Controlled synthetic capability-level cases created only after v0.5.2 implementation and exposed development gates were frozen. These are not real user logs, expert-reviewed clinical gold, model-training data, or clinical validation.",
  "design_note": "Fresh suite stresses nested/contrastive scope, cross-sentence population carryover, passive plus negated relations, multiple numeric distractors, modality and exception scope, temporal composition, and conservative abstention for critical semantics outside the closed proposition ontology. Wording is newly constructed rather than copied from prior exposed suites.",
  "release_criteria": {
    "min_f1": 0.90,
    "min_critical_recall": 0.95,
    "min_polarity_accuracy": 0.95,
    "min_population_accuracy": 0.95,
    "min_condition_accuracy": 0.95,
